{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38924","headline":"登灵山水阁贻钓者 · 杜荀鹤","name":"登灵山水阁贻钓者","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"江上见僧谁是了，修斋补衲日劳身。\n未胜渔父闲垂钓，独背斜阳不采人。\n纵有风波犹得睡，总无蓑笠始爲贫。\n瓦瓶盛酒瓷瓯酌，荻浦芦湾是要津。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜荀鹤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38924.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38924","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}